  TutorialSteps:
  - TopText: Rock Blobs have entered the board! Mergable blobs will try to merge
      with Rocks but it won't work. Instead, Rocks will block direct merges.
    BottomText: Try merging the blue Blob with the rock above it.
    StartX: 1
    StartY: 0
    EndX: 1
    EndY: 2
  - TopText: The Rock Blob prevented the merge! This also means they can never be
      cleared, but they can still be helpful for positioning other Blobs.
    BottomText: Rocks will be cleared on their own after no other blobs remain. Try
      positioning the purple blob in line with the blue blob.
    StartX: 2
    StartY: 2
    EndX: 2
    EndY: 0
  - TopText: Finish the level by merging the pink blob with the Flag!
    BottomText: 
    StartX: 0
    StartY: 1
    EndX: 3
    EndY: 1
